BT /FR 9.40 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 207.79 Tm (  switch budget or the dwell would free it, so the surrounding hours are worth more.) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.40 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 195.39 Tm (  This is the one explanation a thermostat cannot give, because a thermostat has no plan) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.40 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 182.99 Tm (  to be constrained by. It is also why the decision is a schedule and not a comparison:) Tj ET
